$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2frd2c  LOC_AFTER=?

* The two-operand read phase, both operands exhausted.  The body of a two-operand loop reaches its rest ` R ` in one machine step, the two operand reads composed by two instances of ~ tm2frd .  Lean: ` OpA.read ` followed by ` OpB.read ` inside ` addLoop_loop ` , ` subLoop_loop ` and ` cmpFrag_loop ` .  The conclusion is the hypothesis the body lemmas ~ tm2fad1 , ~ tm2fad0c , ~ tm2fad0n , ~ tm2fcm1 and ~ tm2fcm0 take.

